@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam BorderColor #334155
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam NoteBorderColor #B6A16C
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
title SS-09  Retire a course or career path
' Requirements: CONTENT-07 CONTENT-08 PATH-02 PATH-03 DISC-04 ROAD-05 ROAD-06 DATA-01 NOTICE-01
hide footbox
autonumber

actor "Faculty owner" as F
participant "CS-GAMUERS" as S
actor "Program Head" as H
F -> S: Request retirement of owned course or career path
S --> H: Show retirement request for review
H -> S: Decide retirement request
alt Retirement not approved
  S --> F: Show review outcome; retain published offering
else Retirement approved
  S --> F: Confirm archive state
  note over S
  Archived course: no new starts or recommendations.
  Existing learners continue their started revision.
  Archived career path: no new recommendations.
  Accepted roadmaps do not change automatically.
  Completions and badges remain saved.
  This is not an urgent takedown.
  end note
end
footer CS-GAMUERS | SS-09 | Product behavior
@enduml
